sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR User
    participant UI as Angular SPA (DashboardComponent)
    participant Controller as AnalyticsController
    participant Service as AnalyticsService
    participant Repo as AnalyticsRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    HR->>UI: Navigate to Dashboard
    UI->>Controller: GET /api/v1/analytics/overview
    Controller->>Service: getOverviewMetrics()
    
    Service->>Repo: countActiveEmployees()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM employees WHERE status = 'ACTIVE'
    DB-->>Repo: 9,850
    
    Service->>Repo: getCompensationSummariesByCurrency()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT currency_code, COUNT(*), MIN(amount), MAX(amount), AVG(amount) FROM salary_records WHERE effective_to IS NULL GROUP BY currency_code
    DB-->>Repo: Aggregated Currency Rows
    
    Service-->>Controller: DashboardOverviewDto
    Controller-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK (JSON)
    UI->>UI: Render KPI Summary Cards & Visual Charts
